      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0055",
      "reading_order": 61,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.6501,
        "t": 707.25234,
        "r": 248.93597159999993,
        "b": 697.1992777230769
      },
      "content": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0056",
      "reading_order": 62,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 58.2615,
        "t": 681.76636,
        "r": 216.5358324,
        "b": 658.0930366705882
      },
      "content": "Your dishwasher has a filtration system that efficiently removes food particles from the wash water."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0057",
      "reading_order": 63,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 58.261499999999984,
        "t": 654.0006599999999,
        "r": 199.60940599999998,
        "b": 630.3273366705881
      },
      "content": "The filter system consists of three parts: a fine filter plate, a coarse filter , and a lower filter."
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0058",
      "reading_order": 64,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 58.261499999999984,
        "t": 624.2728599999999,
        "r": 215.7963846,
        "b": 567.186247070588
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: To avoid damage to dishwasher, do not operate your dishwasher without filters properly installed. Be sure lower filter is securely in place and upper filter assembly is locked into place. If the coarse filter turns freely, it is not locked into place.",
      "severity": "important"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0006",
      "reading_order": 65,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 218.78562927246094,
        "t": 664.0675048828125,
        "r": 305.6214294433594,
        "b": 596.8408508300781
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0006.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0058",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0059",
      "image_hash": "5a74cb1d24800d8ad7901ed99db01839546d6d5d6a405c252224233f1e350ba2",
      "width": 87,
      "height": 67
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0059",
      "reading_order": 66,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.65364479999998,
        "t": 554.8053957999998,
        "r": 202.6975950000002,
        "b": 547.8387172705881
      },
      "content": "The filters may need to be cleaned when:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0060",
      "reading_order": 67,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.6500384,
        "t": 541.95416,
        "r": 224.98808713000017,
        "b": 534.9874814705882
      },
      "content": "■ Visible objects or soils are on fine filter plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0061",
      "reading_order": 68,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.649904400000004,
        "t": 529.09196,
        "r": 175.91136940000013,
        "b": 522.1252814705882
      },
      "content": "■ Dishes feel gritty to the touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0062",
      "reading_order": 69,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.650056,
        "t": 512.6128376,
        "r": 216.5322436,
        "b": 488.93951427058823
      },
      "content": "See the 'Filtration System' section in the full User Instructions for complete removal and maintenance schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0007",
      "reading_order": 70,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 231.43890380859375,
        "t": 558.8560791015625,
        "r": 308.0993347167969,
        "b": 482.79315185546875
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0007.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0062",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0063",
      "image_hash": "f6677d4cda1405af9ab168634239fa8ef39673f4a96caadb1355e01ac493519c",
      "width": 77,
      "height": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0063",
      "reading_order": 71,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.6501,
        "t": 478.41066,
        "r": 279.1415766,
        "b": 463.09065907058823
      },
      "content": "IMPORTANT: Do not use a wire brush or a scouring pad, etc., as they may damage the filters.",
      "severity": "important"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0064",
      "reading_order": 72,
      "section": "Filtration System and Maintenance",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.65010000000001,
        "t": 458.9981238,
        "r": 295.2875412,
        "b": 435.3248004705882
      },
      "content": "Rinse filter under running water until soils are removed. If you have hard-to-remove soils or calcium deposits because of hard water, a soft brush may be required."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0065",
      "reading_order": 73,
      "section": "Drying - Rinse aid is essential",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.8008,
        "t": 707.25234,
        "r": 489.2342959999998,
        "b": 697.1992777230769
      },
      "content": "Drying - Rinse aid is essential",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0066",
      "reading_order": 74,
      "section": "Drying - Rinse aid is essential",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.8008,
        "t": 681.76636,
        "r": 509.75108059999997,
        "b": 649.7397142705881
      },
      "content": "You must use a drying agent such as a rinse aid for good drying performance. Rinse aid along with the Heated Dry option will provide improved drying and avoid excessive moisture on the dishwasher interior."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0008",
      "reading_order": 75,
      "section": "Drying - Rinse aid is essential",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 521.7685546875,
        "t": 682.4707183837891,
        "r": 574.8245239257812,
        "b": 590.0077667236328
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0008.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0066",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0067",
      "image_hash": "7333aeb836198835af906f8b8ee9c9eafbaec786ef7c30a7b8e1f11a22bca0ef",
      "width": 53,
      "height": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0067",
      "reading_order": 76,
      "section": "Press START every time you add a dish",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.8008,
        "t": 582.18764,
        "r": 540.8310271999998,
        "b": 572.1345777230769
      },
      "content": "Press START every time you add a dish",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0068",
      "reading_order": 77,
      "section": "Press START every time you add a dish",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 326.4122,
        "t": 556.70066,
        "r": 498.8091727999988,
        "b": 524.6740142705881
      },
      "content": "If anyone opens the door after the dishwasher has started (such as for adding a dish, even during the delay time), the Start button must be pressed again to resume the cycle."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0069",
      "reading_order": 78,
      "section": "Press START every time you add a dish",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 326.4122,
        "t": 520.581479,
        "r": 491.6105265799992,
        "b": 513.6148004705882
      },
      "content": "Press START and push the door firmly closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0009",
      "reading_order": 79,
      "section": "Press START every time you add a dish",
      "bbox": {
