    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0093",
      "reading_order": 104,
      "section": "Cleaning the Exterior",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.7008,
        "t": 308.64164999999997,
        "r": 135.61640750000004,
        "b": 301.6657813333333
      },
      "content": "Cleaning the Exterior",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0094",
      "reading_order": 105,
      "section": "Cleaning the Exterior",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.70079999999999,
        "t": 297.55695,
        "r": 308.7196105,
        "b": 273.8291469705882
      },
      "content": "Clean the exterior of the dishwasher with only a soft, damp cloth and mild detergent. Avoid using abrasive cleaning products on the exterior of the dishwasher."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0095",
      "reading_order": 106,
      "section": "Cleaning and Maintaining the Interior",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.70079999999998,
        "t": 269.7271935,
        "r": 196.92820350000025,
        "b": 262.75132483333334
      },
      "content": "Cleaning and Maintaining the Interior",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0096",
      "reading_order": 107,
      "section": "Cleaning and Maintaining the Interior",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.70079999999996,
        "t": 258.64252899999997,
        "r": 309.4616075,
        "b": 201.42554697058824
      },
      "content": "Many detergents may leave white spots or a white residue on dishware and on the interior of the dishwasher. Over time this residue can become unsightly and could affect dishwasher performance. Use of a dishwasher cleaning product such as affresh ®  Dishwasher Cleaner can help to remove the residue. Monthly use of affresh ® Dishwasher Cleaner is recommended to help maintain the dishwasher . Follow package directions."
